---
/**
 * HeroDisruptivo - Seção principal da homepage
 * Background animado com gradientes + headline + CTA
 */
---

<section
    class="relative min-h-[95vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 overflow-hidden"
>
    <!-- Background Animado -->
    <div
        class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-full z-0 opacity-40"
    >
        <div
            class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] bg-purple-600 rounded-full blur-[140px] hero-pulse"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] bg-blue-600 rounded-full blur-[140px] hero-pulse delay-700"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[30%] h-[30%] bg-pink-600 rounded-full blur-[160px] hero-pulse delay-1000"
        >
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div
            class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-purple-400 text-sm mb-10 backdrop-blur-xl hero-bounce-slow"
        >
            <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500 animate-ping"
            ></span>
            <span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest"
                >O Fim das Mensalidades de Site</span
            >
        </div>

        <h1
            class="text-6xl md:text-9xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] mb-10 italic uppercase"
        >
            VOCÊ <span
                class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-linear-to-r from-purple-400 via-pink-500 to-blue-500"
                >PENSA</span
            >,<br />
            A I.A. <span class="text-outline">CONSTRÓI.</span>
        </h1>

        <p
            class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-zinc-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14 leading-tight font-medium"
        >
            Crie, desenvolva e hospede seu site profissional sem gastar um
            centavo. <br class="hidden md:block" />
            <span class="text-white bg-purple-600/30 px-2"
                >A tecnologia trabalha para você</span
            >, e não o contrário.
        </p>

        <div
            class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-8"
        >
            <a
                href="/templates"
                class="group relative px-12 py-6 bg-white text-black font-black rounded-full overflow-hidden transition-all hover:scale-110 active:scale-95 shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(168,85,247,0.4)]"
            >
                <span class="relative z-10 text-xl">COMEÇAR GRÁTIS AGORA</span>
                <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-purple-500 to-blue-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
                >
                </div>
                <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 bg-white group-hover:opacity-0 transition-opacity"
                >
                </div>
            </a>
            <a
                href="#exemplos"
                class="flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white font-bold transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm group"
            >
                VER EXEMPLOS REAIS
                <span class="group-hover:translate-y-1 transition-transform"
                    >↓</span
                >
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid Background -->
    <div
        class="absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#80808012_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#80808012_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-size-[40px_40px] mask-[radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)]"
    >
    </div>
</section>
